  description="CallRail call tracking and dynamic number insertion (DNI) setup for Arizona service businesses. Know exactly which campaigns, keywords, and pages produce phone leads."
  url="https://ziaflow.com/platforms/callrail"
  eyebrow="Call Attribution · Dynamic Number Insertion"
  heroLines={['Attribute every', 'inbound phone call.']}
  heroIntro="For Arizona service businesses, the phone call is often the primary conversion—and standard web analytics misses it completely. We wire CallRail directly into your website, Google Ads, GBP, and Supabase lead ledger."
  deliverables={[
    {
      title: 'Dynamic Number Insertion (DNI) Pools',
      tag: 'Page & Keyword Level',
      description:
        'Dedicated tracking numbers across Google Ads, Local Service Ads, Google Business Profile, and organic search so every call is tied to its exact source.',
    },
    {
      title: 'Missed-Call Instant Text-Back & Dispatch',
      tag: 'Lead Rescue',
      description:
        'Webhook integration that immediately texts back a missed caller and dispatches an urgent alert to your on-call staff.',
    },
    {
      title: 'Call Recording, Transcripts & Lead Qualification',
      tag: 'Quality Control',
      description:
